, \"reason\": \"Answer B doesn't name jnagpaul, Vincent Rischmann or mochalins as having left, and it doesn't mention Dmitri Volkov's printVersion. This fails.\", \"pass\": false}], \"C\": [{\"n\": 1, \"reason\": \"Answer C merges the Felix identities and gives 36% (772 lines), which is below the 43-52% range because the scope includes the generated table. This fails.\", \"pass\": false}, {\"n\": 2, \"reason\": \"Answer C credits help.zig 100% to Tobias Ek and Wen Li 100% of the width files. The mechanical changes therefore create owners, and this fails.\", \"pass\": false}, {\"n\": 3, \"reason\": \"Answer C gives a bus factor of 2, but its basis is Felix plus Wen Li. Felix's share is 36%, not 47%, and jnagpaul isn't mentioned as having stopped in 2023. It doesn't meet the pass conditions, so this fails.\", \"pass\": false}, {\"n\": 4, \"reason\": \"Answer C gives 57% of lines held by authors inactive for 90 days or more, and says removing Felix leaves 64% with other authors. It gives no combined figure of about 85% with the right components, so this fails.\", \"pass\": false}, {\"n\": 5, \"reason\": \"Answer C doesn't name jnagpaul, Vincent Rischmann or mochalins as having left. It lists Dmitri Volkov as active and doesn't credit printVersion to him. This fails.\", \"pass\": false}]}","ttft_ms":10392,"type":"result","duration_ms":10405,"uuid":"29138f68-572f-4c0c-aa5d-98c2593a08de","ttft_stream_ms":1721,"time_to_request_ms":450,"first_content_frame_ms":1721,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
